Hi guys,

There's a new patch! We've fixed some things. Here's a short list:

[list]
[*] Fixed some spelling errors;
[*] Tweaked/fixed some animations of characters in the cinematics;
[*] Fixed some bugs around the part of the Conductor's bridge;
[*] Fixed a checkpoint at the Bird Goddess;
[*] Fixed problems with the idle animation of the Guide;
[*] Fixed some collision problems in world 2;
[*] Some other small bugfixes and adjustments.
[/list]

Of course, we still appreciate any feedback we get from you guys. Don't hesitate to post on the forums or mail us at support@karmaflowgame.com. Bug reports, improvements, suggestions, anything. Or just say hi! 

A great day to everyone,
Basecamp Games

